    <h2 class="title">One primitive, every language</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">The Rust core is the single source of truth for behavior. Every binding rides the same engine and the same commit format — write from one language, read from another. Registry packages aren't published yet — clone the repo and build from source (each guide has the full steps).</p>
